  "baked-lemon-cod": ["Preheat the oven to 200C (400F).","Place the fish and broccoli on a baking tray.","Top the fish with minced garlic and lemon slices.","Bake for 15-20 minutes until the fish flakes easily."],
  'chicken-parmesan': ["Preheat oven to 200°C (400°F). Prepare chicken, tomato, mozzarella, bread.","Mix ingredients together and place in a baking dish.","Bake until cooked through and golden on top, about 25-30 minutes.","Let rest for 5 minutes before serving."],
  'beef-burger-bowls': ["Prepare beef, lettuce, tomato, cheese. Heat pan or pot over medium heat.","Cook aromatics and protein until browned.","Add remaining ingredients and simmer until flavors meld.","Serve hot."],
