  'chicken-noodle-soup': ["Prepare chicken, pasta, carrot, onion. Heat pan or pot over medium heat.","Cook aromatics and protein until browned.","Add remaining ingredients and simmer until flavors meld.","Serve hot."],
  'minestrone-soup': ["Prepare pasta, beans, tomato, zucchini. Heat pan or pot over medium heat.","Cook aromatics and protein until browned.","Add remaining ingredients and simmer until flavors meld.","Serve hot."],
  'eggplant-parmesan': ["Prepare eggplant, tomato, mozzarella, cheese. Heat pan or pot over medium heat.","Cook aromatics and protein until browned.","Add remaining ingredients and simmer until flavors meld.","Serve hot."],
  'greek-salad': ["Preheat oven to 200°C (400°F). Prepare cucumber, tomato, onion, cheese.","Mix ingredients together and place in a baking dish.","Bake until cooked through and golden on top, about 25-30 minutes.","Let rest for 5 minutes before serving."],
  'chicken-quesadilla': ["Prepare chicken, tortilla, cheese, bell pepper. Heat pan or pot over medium heat.","Cook aromatics and protein until browned.","Add remaining ingredients and simmer until flavors meld.","Serve hot."],
